        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$\frac{\alpha_{t} E \Delta Ta^{3}}{6}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>αtEΔTa³/6이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
